      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Monitor"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Monitors provide soft copy visual output and are classified by technology and display characteristics.",
        "Printers are divided into two main categories: Impact printers (physical contact) and Non-Impact printers (no physical contact).",
        "Plotters are specialized output devices designed for high-precision vector graphics and large-scale printing.",
        "Speakers produce sound output by converting digital audio signals into audible sound waves."
      ],
      "id": "0hdh0nc"
    },
